usage: csk shell-init [-h] [--no-global] [--install]
                      [{auto,zsh,bash,powershell}]

positional arguments:
  {auto,zsh,bash,powershell}
                        shell syntax to generate; auto detects zsh/bash from
                        SHELL and PowerShell on Windows

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --no-global           do not activate global CocoaSkills bin
  --install             atomically cache the hook under the CocoaSkills home
                        and print the profile source command

Purpose:
  Prints shell code that activates nearest .agents/env.sh or .agents/env.ps1.

Shell profiles are optional: agent skills resolve project and global shims directly.

Examples:
  csk shell-init --install
  csk shell-init zsh --install
  csk shell-init powershell --install
